IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0035.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 CUSTOMER-AGE       PIC 9(3).
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
    05 ACCT-TYPE          PIC X.
    05 STD-RATE           PIC 9V9999.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 BONUS-RATE         PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 2500-SENIOR-RATE
    DISPLAY "BONUS-RATE=" BONUS-RATE
    STOP RUN.
2500-SENIOR-RATE.
    IF CUSTOMER-AGE >= 65
       AND LEDGER-BAL >= 5000
        COMPUTE BONUS-RATE = STD-RATE + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE STD-RATE TO BONUS-RATE
    END-IF.
